# Use clear language

<h2 id="write-for-the-reader-you-have">Write for the reader you have</h2>

Many adults find long or dense text hard to read. Plain wording helps everyone.

Of adults aged 16 to 65 in England, 18% (6% below Level 1 and 12% at Level 1) read at Level 1 or below. At that level a long page with a lot of detail around the answer is hard to use.

