<h2 id="wg-060">Do not assume who is reading</h2>

Do not assume a relationship, ownership, ability or who is at home.

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| Ask your husband to check the fuse box. | Ask someone who can help with the device. |

<h2 id="wg-062">Use respectful, specific language</h2>

Describe what happens. Avoid “simply”, “obviously” and “just”.

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| Simply restart the router. | Turn the router off, wait 30 seconds, then turn it on again. |

<h2 id="wg-063">Do not assume one way to see, hear or act</h2>

Do not rely on colour, sound or position alone.

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| Tap the green button on the right. | Select **Turn on**. |

<h2 id="wg-065">Preserve language and translation</h2>

Ask a Welsh speaker to write Welsh. Do not publish unchecked machine translation.

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| One button labelled “Save / Cadw” | A separate English button and Welsh button, with the Welsh written by a Welsh speaker. |
